description	"2nd Sister (Trilla Suduri)

A tactical Inquistor with Flash Bangs and High Versatility.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Second Sister's Lightsaber (Staff/Red/Cyan Styles)
-- Cripples On Hit
-- Saber Throw (3)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Deflect (2)
-- 45 Saber Throw Damage
-- 160 Saber Damage
- Flash Grenade (3)
-- Frag Grenade
-- No Damage, 50% Faster RoF
-- Blinds/Stuns/Cripples On Det

^5Force Powers:
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Grip (2)
- Sense (2)
- Jump (3)
- Stasis (3)

^8Attributes:
- Health Regen Capped At 35
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- Anti Mindtrick (2)
- Tracking Beacon
- Stat Viewer

^8Abilities:
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Quickthrow (3) ^[CS3]"